    <svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <symbol id="i-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></symbol>
      <symbol id="i-down-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 5l13 13M18 8v10H8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></symbol>
      <symbol id="i-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M7.6 12.4l3 3 5.8-6.2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></symbol>
          <symbol id="i-up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 18L18 6M8 6h10v10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></symbol>
    </svg>

    <section class="hero hero-about hero-services hero-legal hero-case" aria-labelledby="case-title">
      <span class="hbar hbar-1" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="hbar hbar-2" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="hbar hbar-3" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="hbar hbar-4" aria-hidden="true"></span>

      <div class="ah-copy">
        <p class="ah-label" data-reveal>Case study</p>
        <h1 id="case-title" data-speakable>
          <span class="line">Black</span><span class="line">Chauffeur</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="ah-intro" data-reveal data-speakable>A website concept for a luxury chauffeur service</p>
      </div>

      <div class="svc-index cs-meta" role="group" aria-label="Project details">
        <ol>
          <li data-reveal><div class="si-row"><span class="si-n">Type</span><span class="si-t">Website Concept</span></div></li>
          <li data-reveal><div class="si-row"><span class="si-n">Industry</span><span class="si-t">Luxury Transportation / Chauffeur Services</span></div></li>
          <li data-reveal><div class="si-row"><span class="si-n">Role</span><span class="si-t">Website Design &amp; Front-End Development</span></div></li>
          <li data-reveal><div class="si-row"><span class="si-n">Platform</span><span class="si-t">Systeme.io</span></div></li>
          <li data-reveal><div class="si-row"><span class="si-n">Development</span><span class="si-t">Custom HTML, CSS &amp; JavaScript</span></div></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-dark pj cs-open" id="overview" aria-labelledby="overview-title">
      <div class="ab-in">
        <div class="ab-split">
          <header class="ab-head">
            <p class="ab-k" data-rise>Overview</p>
            <h2 class="cs-h2" id="overview-title">Giving a premium transportation service a website to match.</h2>
          </header>
          <div class="ab-body">
            <p class="ab-lead" data-rise>A chauffeur service sells more than transportation. Its website needs to communicate the level of service, establish the right first impression, and help potential customers understand the available options.</p><p data-rise>Black Chauffeur is a website concept built around that experience. The direction combines a refined visual presentation with organized service information and a booking-oriented user journey.</p>
            <div class="pj-actions" data-rise><a class="cta cta-menu" href="https://mad-car.systeme.io/preview" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>View Live Concept</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span><svg width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-up-right"/></svg></a></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="pj-shot cs-shot" style="--ar:16 / 9"><a class="pj-link" href="https://mad-car.systeme.io/preview" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="assets/img/project-chauffeur.webp" alt="Black Chauffeur website concept: the homepage headline reads Feel the Luxury, Own Every Arrival, over the dark interior of a luxury car, with a Book Now button." width="1280" height="720" decoding="async"><span class="pj-hint" aria-hidden="true">View live</span></a><figcaption>Homepage screenshot of the live concept</figcaption></figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-white cs-sec" id="challenge" aria-labelledby="challenge-title">
      <div class="ab-in">
        <div class="ab-split">
          <header class="ab-head">
            <p class="ab-k" data-rise>The Design Challenge</p>
            <h2 class="cs-h2" id="challenge-title">Communicating a premium service before the journey begins.</h2>
          </header>
          <div class="ab-body">
            <p class="ab-lead" data-rise>For a luxury transportation business, the website plays an important role in shaping expectations. Visitors need to understand what the service offers, who it serves, and how to make an inquiry or reservation.</p><p data-rise>The design direction focused on three priorities:</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="cs-points"><li data-rise><h3>Premium positioning</h3><p>establish a visual identity that reflects the intended level of service.</p></li><li data-rise><h3>Service clarity</h3><p>present transportation options in a way visitors can quickly understand.</p></li><li data-rise><h3>Booking direction</h3><p>make the next step clear for visitors interested in arranging a ride.</p></li></ul>
        <div class="cs-after"><p data-rise>The objective was to create a website that feels appropriate for a premium service while keeping the experience practical.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-amber cs-sec" id="direction" aria-labelledby="direction-title">
      <span class="ab-bar ab-bar-l" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="ab-in">
        <div class="ab-split">
          <header class="ab-head">
            <p class="ab-k" data-rise>The Visual Direction</p>
            <h2 class="cs-h2" id="direction-title">A more refined presentation for a service built around experience.</h2>
          </header>
          <div class="ab-body">
            <p class="ab-lead" data-rise>The visual direction uses a restrained, premium-inspired approach to present the brand and its transportation services.</p><p data-rise>Typography, spacing, imagery, and contrast work together to create a consistent visual identity without making the interface unnecessarily complicated.</p><p data-rise>Key design considerations included:</p>
            <ul class="cs-list" data-rise><li><svg width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg><span>A strong opening section that establishes the brand’s positioning.</span></li><li><svg width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg><span>Clear presentation of chauffeur and transportation services.</span></li><li><svg width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg><span>Visual elements that support the premium brand direction.</span></li><li><svg width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg><span>Structured content that makes important information easier to find.</span></li><li><svg width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg><span>Prominent calls to action that guide visitors toward the next step.</span></li></ul>
            <p data-rise>The goal was to make the website feel polished while keeping its main purpose visible: helping visitors understand and explore the service.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-dark cs-sec" id="development" aria-labelledby="development-title">
      <div class="ab-in">
        <div class="ab-split">
          <header class="ab-head">
            <p class="ab-k" data-rise>The Development</p>
            <h2 class="cs-h2" id="development-title">Building a tailored website within Systeme.io.</h2>
          </header>
          <div class="ab-body">
            <p class="ab-lead" data-rise>The concept was developed using Systeme.io, with custom front-end code to refine the visual presentation and interface.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="dm-rows cs-tools"><li><h3 data-rise>Systeme.io</h3><div data-rise><p>Used as the website platform and publishing environment.</p></div></li><li><h3 data-rise>Custom HTML &amp; CSS</h3><div data-rise><p>Used to build the page structure, visual styling, and responsive layouts.</p></div></li><li><h3 data-rise>JavaScript</h3><div data-rise><p>Used for custom interface behavior where required.</p></div></li></ul>
        <div class="cs-after"><p data-rise>This approach provided greater control over the presentation while keeping the website within its existing platform.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-white cs-sec" id="build" aria-labelledby="build-title">
      <div class="ab-in">
        <div class="ab-split">
          <header class="ab-head">
            <p class="ab-k" data-rise>What Went Into the Build</p>
            <h2 class="cs-h2" id="build-title">Design decisions translated into a working website concept.</h2>
          </header>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-table" data-rise><table><caption class="sr-only">Black Chauffeur: what went into the build</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Area</th><th scope="col">Implementation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Visual direction</th><td>Premium transportation-inspired art direction</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Content structure</th><td>Organized presentation of chauffeur services</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">User experience</th><td>Service-oriented navigation and calls to action</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Typography</th><td>Refined visual hierarchy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Front-end</th><td>Custom HTML, CSS and JavaScript</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Platform</th><td>Systeme.io</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Responsive design</th><td>Layout adjustments for desktop and mobile</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-dark cs-sec" id="result" aria-labelledby="result-title">
      <div class="ab-in">
        <div class="ab-split">
          <header class="ab-head">
            <p class="ab-k" data-rise>The Result</p>
            <h2 class="cs-h2" id="result-title">A premium-focused website concept with a clear service journey.</h2>
          </header>
          <div class="ab-body">
            <p class="ab-lead" data-rise>Black Chauffeur demonstrates how a luxury transportation business can present its services through a cohesive visual identity and an organized website experience.</p><p data-rise>The concept brings together brand presentation, service information, and a booking-oriented interface to help visitors explore the offering and identify the next step.</p><p data-rise>It reflects my approach to service-business websites: the design should communicate the value of the service while making it easy for visitors to understand what to do next.</p>
            <p class="cs-note" data-rise><em>This is an independent website concept, not a commissioned transportation business project. It does not represent verified bookings, customer feedback, or business performance.</em></p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <nav class="cs-next" aria-label="More case studies" data-rise>
          <a href="projects.html#black-chauffeur"><span class="cs-next-k">All projects</span><span class="cs-next-t">Back to the project overview</span></a>
          <a href="case-nicro-industrial.html"><span class="cs-next-k">Next case study</span><span class="cs-next-t">NICRO Industrial</span><svg width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab ab-amber ab-cta" id="lets-talk" aria-labelledby="talk-title">
      <span class="ab-bar ab-bar-l" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="ab-bar ab-bar-r" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="ab-in">
        <h2 class="cs-cta-h" id="talk-title">Does Your Website Reflect the Quality of Your Service?</h2>
        <div class="ab-cta-body">
          <p class="ab-lead" data-rise>When customers are considering a premium service, the website helps shape their expectations before they make contact.</p>
          <p data-rise>I design and develop custom websites that communicate your offering clearly and give potential customers a straightforward path to take the next step.</p>
          <div class="ab-cta-actions" data-rise>
            <a class="cta cta-solid" href="https://calendly.com/-aldrichmatthew/15mins"><span>Book a Free Strategy Call</span><svg width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>
            <a class="cta cta-ghost" href="projects.html"><span>Explore More Projects</span><svg width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  
</Base>
